From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pear <pear@localhost>
Date: Mon, 17 Sep 2001 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [fsdp] feat: optimizer_offload_step, the optimizer states on
 the device for the step only

With FSDP2 and manual optimizer offload, fsdp_config.optimizer_offload_step leaves the AdamW states on the CPU
through train mode's forward and backward passes and loads them around optimizer.step() only. Port of #7804.
